# tccompare must also compare the length of both strings
Zotuluka lembani: (['secret'] tccompare: ['']), mzere-watsopano.
Zotuluka lembani: ([''] tccompare: ['secret']), mzere-watsopano.
Zotuluka lembani: (['secret'] tccompare: ['sec']), mzere-watsopano.
Zotuluka lembani: (['sec'] tccompare: ['secret']), mzere-watsopano.
Zotuluka lembani: (['secret'] tccompare: ['secret']), mzere-watsopano.
Zotuluka lembani: ([''] tccompare: ['']), mzere-watsopano.
